        "content": "Run **`python3 monitoring/scaleout/run.py run both --wasm-mode host`** to start a real additional Wasm host pod with providers and serving components. Java adds only an order-service pod, so these scale different scopes. Use **`--wasm-mode concurrency`** for the previous existing-host test. Images may be cached. Readiness requires runtime inventory, matching images, a direct successful order against the new pod and a ready persistent HTTP endpoint. The report separates common pod Ready/direct-order timings, command acceptance, full capacity and traffic recovery. Use repeat.py for five alternating pairs and median/range charts. Recovery requires two full passing request-start windows after readiness. Original capacity/version is restored; keep the runner terminal open."
